          "text": "Description: Through a telephone call, the GEIPAN is informed that numerous people have been observing since late August, in the late afternoon, a stationary black spot on the sun. No other testimonies or information will be received to supplement the telephone call. Due to the lack of additional information to date, this phenomenon is classified as C.",
